      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1356291774,
      "text": "Ligustrum lucidum, the broad-leaf privet, Chinese privet, glossy privet, tree privet or wax-leaf privet, is a species of flowering plant in the olive family Oleaceae, native to the southern half of China and naturalized in many places. The name \"Chinese privet\" is also used for Ligustrum sinense."
